   Backup rules for API 30 and below, keep in sync with data_extraction_rules.xml.
   See https://developer.android.com/guide/topics/data/autobackup

   Files that must stay on the device get an <exclude> here. Paths take no wildcards, so a file
   under a folder with a variable name (like profiles/<id>/) goes in noBackupFilesDir instead,
   which Android never backs up. Secrets (secrets.preferences_pb) live there.
